    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">JLR302 · Chapter 4 · Session 20</span>\n<h2>Session 20 — Session 20: Đạo đức trong NCKH: Vấn đề bản quyền (2)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13875 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">JLR302 · Chương 4 · Buổi 20</span>\n<h2>Buổi 20 — Session 20: Đạo đức trong NCKH: Vấn đề bản quyền (2)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13875 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO2, CLO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">I, T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO2, CLO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">I, T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Session 20: Đạo đức trong NCKH: Vấn đề bản quyền (2)<br>Nguyên tắc trích dẫn theo định dạng APA (1)</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>*Slide bài giảng session 20</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>1) Nắm được Nguyên tắc trích dẫn theo định dạng APA<br>2) Thảo luận đặt câu hỏi với ND chưa rõ.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>📑 School slides — Session 20 (10 slides)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">matched by the session number in the deck name. File: Session 20.pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>📑 Slide của trường — Session 20 (10 slide)</h3>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">ghép theo số buổi ghi trong tên deck. Tệp: Session 20.pptx</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/JLR302/flm1/d20/001.webp\" alt=\"JLR302 · Session 20 · slide 1: 研究方法\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session 20 · slide 1/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>研究方法<br>HuongNTQ12<br>1</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/JLR302/flm1/d20/002.webp\" alt=\"JLR302 · Session 20 · slide 2: 内容\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session 20 · slide 2/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>内容<br>APAスタイルによる引用方法</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/JLR302/flm1/d20/003.webp\" alt=\"JLR302 · Session 20 · slide 3: 「APA Style」とは？\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session 20 · slide 3/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>「APA Style」とは？<br>PA styleのAPA：<br>「American Psychological Association<br>（米国心理学会）」の略。<br>APAスタイル：米国心理学会が定めた学術論文やアカデミックな文書を書く際に使われる書式。</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/JLR302/flm1/d20/004.webp\" alt=\"JLR302 · Session 20 · slide 4: 4\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session 20 · slide 4/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>4<br>APAスタイルによる引用方法<br>主に 2 種類の示し方がある</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/JLR302/flm1/d20/005.webp\" alt=\"JLR302 · Session 20 · slide 5: 5\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session 20 · slide 5/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>5<br>APAスタイルによる引用方法<br>新聞記事等で、記者名がある場合は、そちらを優先<br>機関名等、略語は使う場合は、初出の時は正式な形で明記し、 [] 内に略語の形を明記。その 後は略語を使用。また、参考文献リスト内では正式な形で明記する。<br>ウェブページ等、投稿日時がわからない場合は n.d を用いる。</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/JLR302/flm1/d20/006.webp\" alt=\"JLR302 · Session 20 · slide 6: 6\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session 20 · slide 6/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>6<br>APAスタイルによる引用方法</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/JLR302/flm1/d20/007.webp\" alt=\"JLR302 · Session 20 · slide 7: 7\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session 20 · slide 7/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>7<br>APAスタイルによる引用方法</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/JLR302/flm1/d20/008.webp\" alt=\"JLR302 · Session 20 · slide 8: 8\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session 20 · slide 8/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>8<br>APAスタイルによる引用方法</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/JLR302/flm1/d20/009.webp\" alt=\"JLR302 · Session 20 · slide 9: 9\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session 20 · slide 9/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>9<br>APAスタイルによる引用方法</p></div>\n<div class=\"anh-slide\"><img src=\"https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/JLR302/flm1/d20/010.webp\" alt=\"JLR302 · Session 20 · slide 10: 10\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"721\" /><p class=\"chu-thich\">Session 20 · slide 10/10</p></div>\n<div class=\"trich-slide\"><p class=\"nhan\">Trên slide · On the slide</p><p>10<br>APAスタイルによる引用方法</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
